  "post_content": "<p>Los actos conmemorativos del D&iacute;a del Libro han comenzado ya en la Papeler&iacute;a La Repro (Avenida Sierra Espad&aacute;n, 74), a mediod&iacute;a de hoy con un concierto del d&uacute;o&nbsp;&quot;Trobadorets&quot; para ni&ntilde;os y ni&ntilde;as. Durante hoy, El s&aacute;bado 21, y el lunes 23, realizan descuento del 5% en la compra de libros.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadoretsdiallibrerepro/img_5078.jpg\" alt=\"img_5078\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadoretsdiallibrerepro/img_5079.jpg\" alt=\"img_5079\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadoretsdiallibrerepro/img_5080.jpg\" alt=\"img_5080\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadoretsdiallibrerepro/img_5081.jpg\" alt=\"img_5081\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadoretsdiallibrerepro/img_5082.jpg\" alt=\"img_5082\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadoretsdiallibrerepro/img_5083.jpg\" alt=\"img_5083\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadoretsdiallibrerepro/img_5084.jpg\" alt=\"img_5084\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadoretsdiallibrerepro/img_5085.jpg\" alt=\"img_5085\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadoretsdiallibrerepro/img_5086.jpg\" alt=\"img_5086\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadoretsdiallibrerep